# The Lander's build context is the repo root. Admit only what its image
# copies: the sdk and what it imports, for `bundleRules` (W3 306). Nothing
# else of the repo, no env file and no node_modules, reaches the build.
**
!packages/brand/package.json
!packages/brand/src/**
!packages/protocol/package.json
!packages/protocol/src/**
!packages/sdk/package.json
!packages/sdk/src/**
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
